[stderr] before writing an R-series file. Do not infer, approve, or implement unresolved
[stderr] decisions. This collection is a child of the factory collection and its R-series
[stderr] output is registered as its own child collection.
[stderr] 
[stderr] The initial wave is deliberately limited to the already allocated SHARD-01
[stderr] foundation contracts. Future work is created only by the dispatcher, one
[stderr] catalogue chapter and at most ten B-series tasks at a time.
