[stderr] task_id: D0001
[stderr] sequence: 8
[stderr] title: Dispatch the next bounded implementation-runbook authoring wave
[stderr] browser_impact: not_applicable
[stderr] playwright_spec:
[stderr] ---
[stderr] 
[stderr] ## Objective
[stderr] 
[stderr] Run one durable authoring-dispatch iteration after the bootstrap B0001–B0006
[stderr] wave. First expand at most one eligible queued specification/catalogue chapter
[stderr] into no more than 250 `IMP-*` records and validate its requirement/dependency
[stderr] coverage. Then allocate ready, unassigned contracts into at most ten new
[stderr] B-series authoring tasks, each with at most seven R-series outputs. Create
[stderr] exactly one successor dispatcher when a queued chapter or ready contract
[stderr] remains; create the final audit B-series task instead only when neither exists.
[stderr] Exit after creating that bounded set.
[stderr] 
[stderr] ## Context packet
