[stderr] Read `INITIAL.md`, `../PROJECT_BRIEF.md`, `../specification/README.md`,
[stderr] `../planning/implementation-catalogue-index.json`,
[stderr] `../planning/runbook-authoring-manifest.json`, its Markdown ledger, and
