[stderr] ## Acceptance criteria
[stderr] 
[stderr] - This iteration expands at most one eligible chapter and adds no more than 250 IMP contracts.
[stderr] - It creates at most ten bounded B-series authoring tasks, each with at most seven assigned R-series outputs.
[stderr] - Every created B task has its context packet, output list, validation, checkpoint/update, collision protection, and stop condition.
