[stderr] 
[stderr] | ID | Domain | Outcome | Prerequisites | Gate/status |
[stderr] | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
[stderr] | IMP-0001 | Foundation | Reproducible shared project baseline | — | GATE-0001 / gated |
[stderr] | IMP-0002 | Foundation | Core and adapter dependency seams | IMP-0001 | current |
