d by authoring alone |\n+\n+The current safe boundary is an original, offline-capable, single-player 2D\n+fantasy RPG with one town, one dungeon, a short guided campaign and ending.\n+Connected identity/account state, multiplayer and safety services, live\n+operations, purchases/entitlements, advanced analytics/monetisation, seasonal\n+events, and player-created/shared content remain excluded or held until a new\n+approved product, privacy, security, operational, cost, and failure-mode\n+contract exists.\n\ncodex\n{\"status\":\"pass\",\"summary\":\"Created the project-scoped runbook factory handoff README with commands, boundaries, evidence map, scaling/resume guidance, and implementation pipeline details.\",\"changed_files\":[\"projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/README.md\"],\"test_result\":\"Passed: git diff --check -- projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/README.md. Passed: required handoff command/link/content markers verified with rg. No browser checks apply to this documentation-only task.\",\"evidence\":{\"agent_log\":\"Codebase Memory MCP architecture lookup was unavailable (cancelled); focused repository inspection was used for the project\u2019s existing planning, manifest, authoring, and Supervisor CLI artifacts.\",\"adapter_log\":\"\",\"test_log\":\"git diff --check completed with no output (success). Required README markers were found, including factory/B/R commands, validator, domain discovery, canonical specification, and Codex pipeline.\",\"browser_log\":\"Not applicable: no browser-facing product or test change.\",\"screenshots\":[]},\"acceptance_results\":[{\"criterion\":\"The README gives exact, project-relative commands to run the factory, then the B-series collection, then selected/all R-series implementation contracts.\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":\"README sections 1\u20133 provide exact repository-root Supervisor commands for the F-series factory, B-series collection/single B writer, selected R0001, and all generated R-series contracts.\"},{\"criteri